menu "Chest controller"

config CHEST_ENABLE_SERVO
    bool "Enable SG90 lid actuator"
    default n
    help
        Initialize and drive the SG90 lid actuator after a verified KWS and
        voiceprint event. The C5 servo branch enables this in sdkconfig.defaults
        after the PWM wiring and external 5 V supply are connected.

endmenu
